<title>AUSTRIA: MOTORCYCLING-AUSTRIAN 500CC FINAL QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-AUSTRIAN 500CC FINAL QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>ZELTWEG, Austria 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>Saturday's final qualifying session for Sunday's Austrian 500cc</p>
<p>motorcycling Grand Prix (circuit length 4.318 kilometres, 2.683</p>
<p>miles):</p>
<p> 1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda, one minute 28.803</p>
<p> 2. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda		   1:29.113</p>
<p> 3. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda		    1:29.310</p>
<p> 4. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda		     1:29.399</p>
<p> 5. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha		   1:29.688</p>
<p> 6. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda		    1:29.758</p>
<p> 7. Alberto Puig (Spain) Honda		     1:30.615</p>
<p> 8. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda		     1:30.767</p>
<p> 9. Anthony Gobert (Australia) Suzuki	    1:30.803</p>
<p> 10. Daryl Beattie (Australia) Suzuki	    1:30.813</p>
